Package: fabricatr
Title: Tidyverse-First Data Fabrication
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Alex Coppock [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Alex Coppock <acoppock@gmail.com>
Description: Helps you imagine your data before you collect it. Builds a data
    frame one column at a time, with hierarchical levels, cross-classified
    levels, potential outcomes, and draws with a target intra-cluster
    correlation, so that a research design can be simulated and diagnosed
    before any data exist. Version 2.0 is a rewrite of the same public API on
    dplyr, tibble, purrr, and rlang.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    tibble,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    stats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    MASS,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
